<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> a djr:Document ;
    skos:prefLabel "implementation-django-final"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s003-1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 1. Django 설계 철학"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s003-1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s003-1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1148 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango 공식 문서에 명시된 설계 철학은 모든 Django 코드 작성의 기반이다. **[DDP]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.1 전체 철학 (Overall)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 원칙 | 설명 |\n|------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| **Loose Coupling** | 프레임워크의 각 계층은 서로에 대해 최소한만 안다. 템플릿은 웹 요청을 모르고, 데이터베이스 계층은 화면 표시를 모른다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1149 ;
    djr:text "| **Less Code** | 앱은 최소한의 코드로 작성되어야 하며, 보일러플레이트를 배제한다. Python의 동적 기능(인트로스펙션 등)을 최대한 활용한다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| **Quick Development** | 웹 개발의 지루한 측면을 빠르게 처리하는 것이 프레임워크의 존재 이유다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1150 ;
    djr:text "| **Don't Repeat Yourself (DRY)** | 모든 고유한 개념과 데이터는 하나의 장소에만 존재해야 한다. 중복은 나쁘고, 정규화가 좋다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1151 ;
    djr:text "| **Explicit is Better Than Implicit** | PEP 20의 원칙. \"마법\"은 그것이 달성하기 어려운 거대한 편의를 제공하면서도 개발자를 혼동시키지 않을 때만 사용한다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s004-1.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1152 ;
    djr:text "| **Consistency** | 저수준(코딩 스타일)부터 고수준(사용 경험)까지 일관성을 유지한다. |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.2 모델 철학 (Models) [DDP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1153 ;
    djr:text "\n- **모델은 객체의 모든 측면을 캡슐화한다** -- Martin Fowler의 Active Record 패턴을 따른다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1154 ;
    djr:text "- 데이터와 데이터에 관한 메타정보(사람이 읽는 이름, 기본 정렬 등) 모두 모델 클래스에 정의한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s005-1.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1155 ;
    djr:text "- 하나의 모델을 이해하는 데 필요한 모든 정보가 모델 안에 있어야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.3 데이터베이스 API 철학 (Database API) [DDP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n| 원칙 | 설명 |\n|------|------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1156 ;
    djr:text "| **SQL Efficiency** | SQL 문을 최소한으로 실행하고, 내부적으로 최적화한다. `save()`는 명시적 호출 필요. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| **Terse, Powerful Syntax** | 최소 구문으로 풍부하고 표현력 있는 문장을 허용한다. 조인은 뒷단에서 자동 수행된다. |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s006-1.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1157 ;
    djr:text "| **Drop Into Raw SQL** | ORM은 지름길이지 끝이 아니다. 커스텀 SQL을 쉽게 작성할 수 있어야 한다. |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.4 URL 설계 철학 (URL Design) [DDP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1158 ;
    djr:text "\n- URL은 Python 함수명에 결합되면 안 된다 (Loose Coupling).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 어떤 URL 설계든 허용할 수 있는 **무한한 유연성**을 제공한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1159 ;
    djr:text "- 예쁜 URL을 만드는 것이 못생긴 URL을 만드는 것보다 쉽거나 같아야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s007-1.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1160 ;
    djr:text "- URL에 파일 확장자를 포함시키지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.5 템플릿 시스템 철학 (Template System) [DDP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1161 ;
    djr:text "\n- **로직과 표현을 분리한다** -- 템플릿은 표현과 표현 관련 로직만 제어한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1162 ;
    djr:text "- **프로그래밍 언어를 발명하지 않는다** -- 분기와 반복 등 표현에 필수적인 기능만 제공한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s008-1.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- HTML에 종속되지 않는다 -- 모든 텍스트 기반 형식을 생성할 수 있다.\n- 안전과 보안이 기본이다 -- 악의적인 코드 실행을 원천 차단한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 1.6 뷰 철학 (Views) [DDP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "1.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1163 ;
    djr:text "\n- 뷰 작성은 Python 함수 작성만큼 단순해야 한다 -- 함수로 충분할 때 클래스를 인스턴스화하지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1164 ;
    djr:text "- 요청 객체를 전역 변수가 아닌 직접 전달받아 테스트를 쉽게 만든다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1165 ;
    djr:text "- GET과 POST를 명확히 구분한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s009-1.6/b4> a djr:Block ;
