<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.2 임포트 순서 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1169 ;
    djr:text "\n임포트는 다음 그룹 순서로 정렬하며, 그룹 내에서는 알파벳순으로 정렬한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 1. future\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\n# 2. standard library\nimport json\nfrom itertools import chain\n\n# 3. third-party\nimport bcrypt\n\n# 4. Django 컴포넌트\nfrom django.http import Http404\nfrom django.http.response import (\n    HttpResponse,\n    HttpResponseNotAllowed,\n    StreamingHttpResponse,\n)\n\n# 5. 로컬 Django 컴포넌트 (한 점 상대 임포트)\nfrom .models import LogEntry\n\n# 6. try/except\ntry:\n    import yaml\nexcept ImportError:\n    yaml = None\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1170 ;
    djr:text "- `isort`를 사용하여 자동 정렬한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1171 ;
    djr:text "- **편의 임포트를 사용한다**: `from django.views import View` (O), `from django.views.generic.base import View` (X).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s012-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1172 ;
    djr:text "- 여러 점 상대 임포트(`from ...utils import`)를 피하고 절대 임포트를 사용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s013-2.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.3 문자열 포매팅 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s013-2.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s013-2.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1173, djr:R-1174, djr:R-1175 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: f-string 내에서 단순 속성 접근\nf\"hello {user}\"\nf\"hello {user.name}\"\nf\"hello {self.user.name}\"\n\n# 나쁜 예: f-string 내에서 함수 호출이나 연산\nf\"hello {get_user()}\"                   # 함수 호출 금지\nf\"you are {user.age * 365.25} days old\" # 연산 금지\n\n# 좋은 예: 복잡한 표현은 지역 변수로 분리\nuser = get_user()\nf\"hello {user}\"\n\n# 번역 대상 문자열에는 f-string을 사용하지 않는다\n_(\"Hello %(name)s\") % {\"name\": user.name}  # O\n_(f\"Hello {user.name}\")                      # X\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s014-2.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.4 모델 코딩 스타일 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s014-2.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s014-2.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1176 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nclass Person(models.Model):\n    # 1. 데이터베이스 필드 (all lowercase with underscores)\n    first_name = models.CharField(max_length=20)\n    last_name = models.CharField(max_length=40)\n    email = models.EmailField(unique=True)\n\n    # 2. 커스텀 Manager\n    objects = PersonManager()\n\n    # 3. class Meta\n    class Meta:\n        verbose_name_plural = \"people\"\n        ordering = [\"last_name\", \"first_name\"]\n\n    # 4. __str__ 및 기타 Python 매직 메서드\n    def __str__(self):\n        return f\"{self.first_name} {self.last_name}\"\n\n    # 5. save(), delete()\n    def save(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        self.email = self.email.lower()\n        super().save(*args, **kwargs)\n\n    # 6. get_absolute_url()\n    def get_absolute_url(self):\n        return reverse(\"person-detail\", kwargs={\"pk\": self.pk})\n\n    # 7. 커스텀 메서드\n    def get_full_name(self):\n        return f\"{self.first_name} {self.last_name}\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.5 선택지(Choices) 정의 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 순수 인프라 필드(도메인 판정 없음): TextChoices 자체 선언\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    class Status(models.TextChoices):\n        DRAFT = \"draft\", \"Draft\"\n        PENDING = \"pending\", \"Pending\"\n        COMPLETED = \"completed\", \"Completed\"\n\n    status = models.CharField(\n        max_length=20,\n        choices=Status,\n        default=Status.DRAFT,\n    )\n\n# Django 5.0+ 딕셔너리 구문도 가능\nclass Shirt(models.Model):\n    size = models.CharField(\n        max_length=2,\n        choices={\"S\": \"Small\", \"M\": \"Medium\", \"L\": \"Large\"},\n    )\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1177, djr:R-1178, djr:R-1179, djr:R-1180, djr:R-1181, djr:R-1182 ;
    djr:text "**계층 소유 — 도메인 판정에 쓰이는 값 집합의 단일 출처는 domain_layer의 `StrEnum`이다.** 위 TextChoices 자체 선언은 도메인 판정에 쓰이지 않는 **순수 인프라 필드에 한정**한다 — 도메인 상태를 TextChoices로 선언하면 domain이 판정 시 ORM 타입을 역참조하게 된다(`architecture-ddd` §3.2). 도메인 상태 필드는 domain Enum에서 파생시킨다. 순수 인프라 필드였던 값에 도메인 판정이 처음 생기는 슬라이스에서 파생형으로 전환한다(값 불변이면 `choices` 변경은 DB 무영향). 기존 TextChoices 실물이 여러 곳에 보여도 그것은 규약이 아니라 아직 안 갚은 빚이다 — 값 집합의 배치에 기존 배치는 입력이 아니다(`discipline-houserules` §1.1·§4 — 2026-08-12).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# domain_layer/order/value_object/order_status.py — 단일 출처\nclass OrderStatus(StrEnum):\n    PENDING = \"pending\"\n    COMPLETED = \"completed\"\n\n# driven_layer/django_order/models/order_model.py — 파생 (사람용 라벨(i18n) 필요 시 명시 매핑 병기)\nclass OrderModel(models.Model):\n    status = models.CharField(\n        max_length=20,\n        choices=[(s.value, s.name.title()) for s in OrderStatus],\n        default=OrderStatus.PENDING.value,  # .value 평탄화 — 아래 참조\n    )\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1183, djr:R-1184, djr:R-1185 ;
    djr:text "**`.value` 평탄화**: `default=` 등 마이그레이션이 직렬화하는 자리에 순수 StrEnum **멤버를 직접 두면** Django `EnumSerializer`가 마이그레이션 파일에 **살아있는 enum 참조**(`OrderStatus[\"PENDING\"]` + domain import)를 박는다 — 값 동결 직렬화(`ChoicesSerializer`)는 `models.Choices` 전용이다. domain Enum 파생 시에는 `.value`로 평탄화한다(단일 출처에서의 파생이므로 심볼 소비로 인정). `CheckConstraint`(`check=`)·부분 인덱스의 `Q()` 조건 값도 같은 파생으로 쓴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1186, djr:R-1187, djr:R-1188 ;
    djr:text "**소비 규율**: `choices`/Enum이 선언된 필드 값의 비교·분기·`.filter()`·대입·`default`는 반드시 심볼로 참조한다 — `.filter(status=\"pending\")` 금지 → `.filter(status=OrderStatus.PENDING)`. 비교는 `==`(`is` 금지 — 필드 값은 plain str로 흐른다). 복합 상태 판정의 1차 시정은 애그리거트 술어·enum 프로퍼티다(`architecture-ddd` §3.2) — 심볼 치환이 판정 소유를 면책하지 않는다. 승격 판정·리터럴 허용 목록은 `discipline-cleancode` §2.14.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s016-2.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.6 템플릿 코딩 스타일 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s016-2.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s016-2.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1189 ;
    djr:text "\n템플릿 코딩 스타일과 표현 계층 규칙은 `implementation-django-web`(§4)가 소유한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s017-2.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.7 뷰 코딩 스타일 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s017-2.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s017-2.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1190 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: 첫 번째 매개변수는 반드시 request\ndef my_view(request, article_id):\n    ...\n\n# 나쁜 예\ndef my_view(req, article_id):   # req가 아닌 request 사용\n    ...\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s017-2.7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s017-2.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.1 프로젝트 레이아웃 [TSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\nTwo Scoops of Django가 권장하는 구조.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```\nrepository_root/\n    .gitignore\n    requirements/\n        base.txt\n        dev.txt\n        prod.txt\n    config/                  # 프로젝트 설정 (TSD는 config/ 사용 권장)\n        __init__.py\n        settings/\n            __init__.py\n            base.py          # 공통 설정\n            local.py         # 개발 설정\n            production.py    # 운영 설정\n            test.py          # 테스트 설정\n        urls.py\n        wsgi.py\n        asgi.py\n    apps/\n        users/\n            __init__.py\n            models.py\n            views.py\n            urls.py\n            forms.py\n            services.py      # 서비스 레이어 (HS 패턴)\n            selectors.py     # 셀렉터 (HS 패턴)\n            tests/                       # 의미군으로 분리(평면 나열 금지); 조직 규칙은 implementation-test §4.2 소유\n                __init__.py\n                unit/\n                integration/\n            admin.py\n        orders/\n            ...\n    manage.py\n    docker-compose.yml\n    Dockerfile\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1191, djr:R-1192 ;
    djr:text "> 테스트 디렉터리 조직(`unit`/`integration`/`e2e` 의미군 분리, 디렉터리별 conftest)은 `implementation-test` §4.2가 소유한다. 위 `tests/`는 앱별 배치 시의 형태 예시이며, 테스트 파일을 한 디렉터리에 평면으로 나열하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s019-3.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1193, djr:R-1194 ;
    djr:text "> dddjango가 *생성하는 코드*의 구체 표준 파일트리는 `discipline-houserules` 스킬이 소유한다(표준 트리는 그 `references/final.md`) — §3.1의 설정 분할·앱 단위 조직을 토대로 구체화한 표준이며, 생성 코드 배치 권위는 그 문서가 갖는다. 여기 §3.1은 그 표준의 배경이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.2 앱 분리 기준 [TSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: 앱은 하나의 응집된 도메인 개념에 대응\n# users/ -- 사용자 관리\n# orders/ -- 주문 관리\n# products/ -- 상품 관리\n\n# 나쁜 예: 모든 것이 하나의 앱에\n# core/ -- 사용자, 주문, 상품, 결제 전부 포함\n# api/  -- 모든 API 엔드포인트를 하나의 앱에\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1195 ;
    djr:text "- 앱 이름은 **간결한 복수형 단어** 사용: `users`, `orders`, `payments`.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1196 ;
    djr:text "- 한 문장으로 앱의 목적을 설명할 수 없다면 분리가 필요하다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s020-3.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1197 ;
    djr:text "- 앱 간 순환 의존이 생기면 설계를 재검토한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.3 설정(Settings) 분리 [TSD] [DfP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# config/settings/base.py\nimport environ\n\nenv = environ.Env(\n    DEBUG=(bool, False),\n)\nenviron.Env.read_env()\n\nSECRET_KEY = env(\"DJANGO_SECRET_KEY\")\nDEBUG = env(\"DEBUG\")\nDATABASES = {\n    \"default\": env.db(\"DATABASE_URL\"),\n}\n\n# config/settings/local.py\nfrom .base import *  # noqa: F401,F403\n\nDEBUG = True\nINSTALLED_APPS += [\"debug_toolbar\"]\n\n# config/settings/production.py\nfrom .base import *  # noqa: F401,F403\n\nDEBUG = False\nSECURE_SSL_REDIRECT = True\nSECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 31536000\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1198 ;
    djr:text "- **비밀 정보는 절대 코드에 하드코딩하지 않는다** -- `django-environ` 또는 `python-decouple`로 환경 변수에서 읽는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s021-3.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1199 ;
    djr:text "- `.env` 파일은 `.gitignore`에 추가한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.4 settings 접근 시 주의사항 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "3.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1200 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 모듈 최상위에서 settings 접근\nfrom django.conf import settings\nfrom django.urls import get_callable\n\ndefault_view = get_callable(settings.FOO_VIEW)  # 임포트 시점에 실행됨\n\n# 좋은 예: 함수/메서드 내에서 지연 접근\nfrom django.conf import settings\n\ndef get_default_view():\n    from django.urls import get_callable\n    return get_callable(settings.FOO_VIEW)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "모듈 임포트 시점에 settings를 사용하면 `settings.configure()`를 통한 수동 설정이 불가능해진다. **[DCS]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s022-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.1 Fat Model, Thin View 원칙 [TSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1201, djr:R-1202 ;
    djr:text "\n> 이 절은 평면 Django(기존 관례 유지보수) 맥락의 원칙이다 — dddjango 표준 4계층에서는 판정·불변식은 `domain_layer` 애그리거트 소유이고 평면 ORM 모델에 판정 메서드를 얹으면 blocker 다(`architecture-ddd` §3.2).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1203 ;
    djr:text "비즈니스 로직은 뷰가 아닌 모델(또는 서비스 레이어)에 둔다. Two Scoops of Django는 이를 **\"Fat Models, Utility Modules, Thin Views, Stupid Templates\"**로 정리한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 나쁜 예: 뷰에 비즈니스 로직 집중\nclass OrderView(View):\n    def post(self, request):\n        order = Order.objects.get(pk=request.POST[\"order_id\"])\n        if order.total > 100:\n            order.discount = order.total * 0.1\n        order.status = \"confirmed\"\n        order.save()\n        send_mail(\"Order confirmed\", ..., [order.user.email])\n        return redirect(\"order-detail\", pk=order.pk)\n\n# 좋은 예: 모델에 비즈니스 로직 캡슐화\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    # ... fields ...\n\n    def confirm(self):\n        \"\"\"주문을 확정하고 할인을 적용한다.\"\"\"\n        if self.total > 100:\n            self.discount = self.total * Decimal(\"0.1\")\n        self.status = self.Status.CONFIRMED\n        self.save(update_fields=[\"discount\", \"status\"])\n        self.send_confirmation_email()\n\n    def send_confirmation_email(self):\n        send_mail(\"Order confirmed\", ..., [self.user.email])\n\n# 뷰는 얇게\nclass OrderConfirmView(View):\n    def post(self, request, pk):\n        order = get_object_or_404(Order, pk=pk)\n        order.confirm()\n        return redirect(\"order-detail\", pk=order.pk)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1204 ;
    djr:text "단, 모델이 2000줄 이상으로 비대해지면 서비스 레이어 분리를 검토한다 (16장 참조).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### Abstract Base Class (추상 베이스 클래스) -- 권장"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: 공통 필드를 추상 클래스로 추출\nclass TimeStampedModel(models.Model):\n    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)\n    updated_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now=True)\n\n    class Meta:\n        abstract = True  # 테이블을 생성하지 않음\n\nclass Article(TimeStampedModel):\n    title = models.CharField(max_length=200)\n    body = models.TextField()\n    # created_at, updated_at 자동 상속\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 테이블을 생성하지 않아 조인 비용이 없다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s026> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1205 ;
    djr:text "- 여러 모델에서 공통 필드를 재사용할 때 가장 적합하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### Multi-table Inheritance -- 주의해서 사용"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1206 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 주의: 각 모델마다 별도 테이블 생성 + 암묵적 OneToOneField\nclass Place(models.Model):\n    name = models.CharField(max_length=50)\n    address = models.CharField(max_length=80)\n\nclass Restaurant(Place):  # place_ptr 자동 생성\n    serves_pizza = models.BooleanField(default=False)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 조회 시 자동으로 JOIN이 발생하여 성능 저하 가능.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s027> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1207 ;
    djr:text "- 대부분의 경우 **Abstract Base Class + 명시적 ForeignKey**가 더 낫다. **[TSD]**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.3 필드 선택 가이드 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: BooleanField 남발로 상태 폭발\nclass Task(models.Model):\n    is_started = models.BooleanField(default=False)\n    is_completed = models.BooleanField(default=False)\n    is_cancelled = models.BooleanField(default=False)\n    # is_started=True, is_completed=True, is_cancelled=True 같은\n    # 불가능한 상태 조합이 가능\n\n# 좋은 예: TextChoices로 상태를 하나의 필드에 표현\nclass Task(models.Model):\n    class Status(models.TextChoices):\n        PENDING = \"pending\", \"Pending\"\n        STARTED = \"started\", \"Started\"\n        COMPLETED = \"completed\", \"Completed\"\n        CANCELLED = \"cancelled\", \"Cancelled\"\n\n    status = models.CharField(\n        max_length=20,\n        choices=Status,\n        default=Status.PENDING,\n    )\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- `CharField` + `TextChoices`는 DB에서 직접 읽을 때 가독성이 좋다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b2> ;
    djr:text "- 단 이 `Status`가 도메인 판정(전이·terminal)에 쓰이면 §2.5 계층 소유대로 domain Enum 파생으로 선언한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `IntegerChoices`는 저장 공간이 약간 효율적이나, 쿼리 성능 차이는 거의 없다. **[DDoc]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1208 ;
    djr:text "- `JSONField`는 스키마 없는 데이터에만 사용하고, 구조화된 데이터에는 정규 필드를 사용한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s029-4.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1209, djr:R-1210 ;
    djr:text "- `DecimalField`를 금액에 사용하고, `FloatField`는 피한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.4 모델 유효성 검증 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nclass Event(models.Model):\n    start_date = models.DateField()\n    end_date = models.DateField()\n\n    def clean(self):\n        \"\"\"모델 레벨 교차 필드 유효성 검증.\"\"\"\n        if self.start_date and self.end_date and self.start_date > self.end_date:\n            raise ValidationError(\n                {\"end_date\": \"종료일은 시작일 이후여야 합니다.\"}\n            )\n\n    class Meta:\n        constraints = [\n            models.CheckConstraint(\n                check=models.Q(end_date__gte=models.F(\"start_date\")),\n                name=\"event_end_after_start\",\n            ),\n        ]\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1211 ;
    djr:text "- `clean()` 메서드로 Python 레벨 검증을 수행한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1212 ;
    djr:text "- `CheckConstraint`로 데이터베이스 레벨 제약도 함께 건다 (이중 방어).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1213 ;
    djr:text "- `full_clean()`은 `save()` 시 자동 호출되지 않으므로, 폼이나 Serializer를 통해 호출되도록 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s030-4.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.1 Custom Manager와 QuerySet [DDoc] [TSD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b5> ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nclass ArticleStatus(models.TextChoices):\n    DRAFT = \"draft\", \"Draft\"\n    PUBLISHED = \"published\", \"Published\"\n\n\nclass PublishedQuerySet(models.QuerySet):\n    def published(self):\n        return self.filter(status=ArticleStatus.PUBLISHED)  # 소비 규율(§2.5): 리터럴 아닌 심볼\n\n    def by_author(self, user):\n        return self.filter(author=user)\n\n    def recent(self):\n        return self.order_by(\"-published_at\")\n\n\nclass ArticleManager(models.Manager):\n    def get_queryset(self):\n        return PublishedQuerySet(self.model, using=self._db)\n\n    def published(self):\n        return self.get_queryset().published()\n\n\nclass Article(models.Model):\n    title = models.CharField(max_length=200)\n    status = models.CharField(max_length=20, choices=ArticleStatus)\n    author = models.ForeignKey(User, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n    published_at = models.DateTimeField(null=True)\n\n    # 방법 1: Manager + QuerySet 분리\n    objects = ArticleManager()\n\n    # 방법 2: QuerySet.as_manager() 사용 (더 간결)\n    # objects = PublishedQuerySet.as_manager()\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1214 ;
    djr:text "- **QuerySet 메서드로 체이닝을 가능하게 한다**: `Article.objects.published().by_author(user).recent()`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- `as_manager()`를 사용하면 별도의 Manager 클래스 없이 QuerySet을 매니저로 승격시킬 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s032-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1215 ;
    djr:text "- Manager에서 `get_queryset()`을 오버라이드하여 기본 필터를 적용할 때는 주의한다 -- 관리자 페이지에서 예상과 다르게 동작할 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.2 QuerySet 최적화 필수 패턴 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: N+1 문제 -- 각 book마다 author를 별도 쿼리\nbooks = Book.objects.all()\nfor book in books:\n    print(book.author.name)  # N번의 추가 쿼리\n\n# 좋은 예: select_related -- ForeignKey/OneToOne에 SQL JOIN 사용\nbooks = Book.objects.select_related(\"author\").all()\nfor book in books:\n    print(book.author.name)  # 추가 쿼리 없음 (1번의 JOIN 쿼리)\n\n# 좋은 예: prefetch_related -- ManyToMany/역참조에 별도 쿼리 + Python 조인\nbooks = Book.objects.prefetch_related(\"tags\").all()\nfor book in books:\n    print(list(book.tags.all()))  # 2번의 쿼리 (books + tags IN (...))\n\n# 좋은 예: Prefetch 객체로 커스텀 쿼리셋 사용\nfrom django.db.models import Prefetch\n\nbooks = Book.objects.prefetch_related(\n    Prefetch(\n        \"reviews\",\n        queryset=Review.objects.filter(rating__gte=4).order_by(\"-created_at\"),\n        to_attr=\"top_reviews\",  # list로 캐싱\n    )\n)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "**선택 기준:**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| 관계 유형 | 사용할 메서드 |\n|-----------|--------------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1216 ;
    djr:text "| ForeignKey, OneToOneField | `select_related()` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1217 ;
    djr:text "| ManyToManyField, 역참조 ForeignKey | `prefetch_related()` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s033-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1218 ;
    djr:text "| 조건부 프리페치 | `Prefetch()` 객체 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.3 only(), defer(), values() [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# only(): 지정한 필드만 로드 (나머지는 지연 로드)\nusers = User.objects.only(\"id\", \"username\", \"email\")\n\n# defer(): 지정한 필드를 지연 로드 (나머지는 즉시 로드)\narticles = Article.objects.defer(\"body\")  # 큰 텍스트 필드 지연\n\n# values(): 딕셔너리 리스트 반환 (모델 인스턴스가 아님)\nstats = Order.objects.values(\"status\").annotate(count=Count(\"id\"))\n\n# values_list(): 튜플 리스트 반환\nemails = User.objects.values_list(\"email\", flat=True)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- `only()`/`defer()`는 대용량 텍스트나 변환 비용이 큰 필드에 효과적이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1219 ;
    djr:text "- **프로파일링 없이 공격적으로 사용하지 않는다** -- DB는 대부분의 비텍스트 데이터를 어차피 디스크에서 읽는다. **[DDoc]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s034-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `values()` 후에 `only()`/`defer()`를 호출하면 `TypeError`가 발생한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.4 annotate()와 aggregate() [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom django.db.models import Count, Avg, F, Q\n\n# aggregate(): 전체 QuerySet에 대한 집계값 반환 (딕셔너리)\nresult = Book.objects.aggregate(\n    avg_price=Avg(\"price\"),\n    total=Count(\"id\"),\n)\n# {'avg_price': Decimal('25.50'), 'total': 150}\n\n# annotate(): 각 객체에 계산 필드 추가\nauthors = Author.objects.annotate(\n    book_count=Count(\"book\"),\n    avg_rating=Avg(\"book__reviews__rating\"),\n).filter(book_count__gte=5)\n\n# alias(): 최종 결과에 포함하지 않으면서 필터/정렬에 사용 (Django 3.2+)\nauthors = Author.objects.alias(\n    book_count=Count(\"book\"),\n).filter(book_count__gte=5)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- `annotate()`와 `filter()`의 순서가 결과에 영향을 준다 -- 교환 법칙이 성립하지 않는다. **[DDoc]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s035-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1220 ;
    djr:text "- 최종 결과에 불필요한 계산 필드가 있으면 `alias()`를 사용하여 DB 부담을 줄인다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s036-5.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.5 bulk 연산 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s036-5.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s036-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1221 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 루프 내에서 개별 save()\nfor item in items:\n    item.price *= 1.1\n    item.save()  # N번의 UPDATE\n\n# 좋은 예: bulk_update()\nfor item in items:\n    item.price *= 1.1\nProduct.objects.bulk_update(items, [\"price\"], batch_size=500)\n\n# 좋은 예: bulk_create()\nProduct.objects.bulk_create(\n    [Product(name=name) for name in product_names],\n    batch_size=500,\n)\n\n# 좋은 예: update()로 DB 레벨 일괄 수정\nProduct.objects.filter(category=\"books\").update(\n    price=F(\"price\") * 1.1\n)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s036-5.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s036-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s037-6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 6. 뷰 패턴: CBV vs FBV"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s037-6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s037-6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1222, djr:R-1223, djr:R-1224 ;
    djr:text "\n서버 렌더링 화면의 뷰(CBV/FBV 선택, Generic CBV, Mixin, FBV 작성)는 표현 계층이므로 `implementation-django-web`(§2)가 소유한다. JSON API endpoint의 라우팅/스키마는 `implementation-django-ninja`, REST 계약은 `architecture-api`가 소유한다. 이 문서(코어)는 뷰가 호출하는 service/selector 경계(§16)만 다룬다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s037-6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s037-6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s038-7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 7. 폼과 유효성 검증"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s038-7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s038-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1225, djr:R-1226, djr:R-1227 ;
    djr:text "\n웹 폼(Form/ModelForm 작성, 검증 순서, 커스텀 validator)은 표현 계층이므로 `implementation-django-web`(§6)가 소유한다. 다만 form과 model이 공유하는 durable invariant·validator는 model/DB 경계에서도 보장한다(§4 모델 설계). 도메인 규칙 자체는 `architecture-ddd`가 소유한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s038-7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s038-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s039-8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 8. REST API 경계와 기존 DRF 유지보수"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s039-8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s039-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1228, djr:R-1229, djr:R-1230 ;
    djr:text "\n신규 REST API의 리소스 계약, HTTP 상태 코드, 오류 응답, pagination, versioning, idempotency는 Django 모델/ORM 구현 문제가 아니라 API 계약 문제로 먼저 다룬다. dddjango runtime에서는 greenfield endpoint 구현의 기본 경로를 Django Ninja Router/Schema로 두며, 이 문서의 DRF 내용은 기존 DRF 코드 유지보수, 레거시 migration review, 또는 이미 DRF를 표준으로 채택한 프로젝트 안에서만 적용한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s039-8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s039-8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1231, djr:R-1232 ;
    djr:text "신규 코드에서 DRF `Serializer`, `ViewSet`, `APIView`, `DefaultRouter`를 기본 권장안처럼 제시하지 않는다. 기존 DRF surface를 다룰 때도 도메인 규칙은 serializer/viewset에 흩뿌리지 말고 모델 메서드, service, selector, database constraint 같은 Django-side boundary에 둔다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.1 기존 DRF Serializer 설계 [DRF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: 읽기/쓰기 Serializer 분리\nclass ArticleListSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    \"\"\"목록 조회용 -- 최소 필드.\"\"\"\n    author_name = serializers.CharField(source=\"author.get_full_name\", read_only=True)\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = Article\n        fields = [\"id\", \"title\", \"author_name\", \"published_at\"]\n\nclass ArticleDetailSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    \"\"\"상세 조회/수정용 -- 전체 필드.\"\"\"\n    author = UserSerializer(read_only=True)\n    tags = TagSerializer(many=True, read_only=True)\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = Article\n        fields = [\"id\", \"title\", \"body\", \"author\", \"tags\", \"created_at\", \"updated_at\"]\n\nclass ArticleCreateSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    \"\"\"생성용 -- 쓰기 필드만.\"\"\"\n    class Meta:\n        model = Article\n        fields = [\"title\", \"body\", \"category\"]\n\n    def validate_title(self, value):\n        if Article.objects.filter(title=value).exists():\n            raise serializers.ValidationError(\"이미 존재하는 제목입니다.\")\n        return value\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1233 ;
    djr:text "- 기존 DRF 코드에서는 목록/상세/생성/수정 시나리오마다 Serializer를 분리하면 보안과 성능 모두 개선된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1234 ;
    djr:text "- `fields = \"__all__\"` 을 피한다 -- ModelForm과 같은 이유.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `source` 파라미터로 모델 필드명과 API 필드명을 분리할 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s040-8.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1235 ;
    djr:text "- 검증이 serializer에만 갇히면 다른 entry point에서 불변식이 깨질 수 있다. 여러 entry point가 공유하는 규칙은 모델, service, DB constraint로 올린다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.2 기존 DRF ViewSet과 Router [DRF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom rest_framework import viewsets, permissions\nfrom rest_framework.decorators import action\nfrom rest_framework.response import Response\n\nclass ArticleViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    queryset = Article.objects.select_related(\"author\").prefetch_related(\"tags\")\n    permission_classes = [permissions.IsAuthenticatedOrReadOnly]\n\n    def get_serializer_class(self):\n        if self.action == \"list\":\n            return ArticleListSerializer\n        if self.action == \"create\":\n            return ArticleCreateSerializer\n        return ArticleDetailSerializer\n\n    def perform_create(self, serializer):\n        serializer.save(author=self.request.user)\n\n    @action(detail=True, methods=[\"post\"], permission_classes=[permissions.IsAuthenticated])\n    def publish(self, request, pk=None):\n        article = self.get_object()\n        article.publish()\n        return Response({\"status\": \"published\"})\n\n# urls.py\nfrom rest_framework.routers import DefaultRouter\n\nrouter = DefaultRouter()\nrouter.register(\"articles\", ArticleViewSet)\nurlpatterns = router.urls\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1236 ;
    djr:text "- 기존 DRF 코드에서는 `get_serializer_class()`를 오버라이드하여 액션별 Serializer를 분리한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- `@action`에 `permission_classes`를 별도 지정할 수 있다.\n- `DefaultRouter`를 사용하면 URL 패턴이 자동 생성된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s041-8.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1237 ;
    djr:text "- viewset은 HTTP adapter다. transaction owner, external side effect timing, domain state transition은 명시적인 model/service boundary로 빼서 재사용 가능하게 둔다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.3 Permission 패턴 [DRF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom rest_framework.permissions import BasePermission\n\nclass IsAuthorOrReadOnly(BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"작성자만 수정/삭제 가능, 나머지는 읽기만.\"\"\"\n    def has_object_permission(self, request, view, obj):\n        if request.method in permissions.SAFE_METHODS:\n            return True\n        return obj.author == request.user\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1238 ;
    djr:text "- 전역 기본 permission은 `settings.py`의 `DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES`에 설정.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1239 ;
    djr:text "- ViewSet 레벨에서 `permission_classes`로 오버라이드.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s042-8.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1240 ;
    djr:text "- 객체 레벨 권한은 `has_object_permission()`에서 처리.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.4 Pagination 설정 [DRF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# settings.py\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    \"DEFAULT_PAGINATION_CLASS\": \"rest_framework.pagination.PageNumberPagination\",\n    \"PAGE_SIZE\": 20,\n}\n\n# 커스텀 페이지네이션\nclass LargeResultsSetPagination(PageNumberPagination):\n    page_size = 100\n    page_size_query_param = \"page_size\"\n    max_page_size = 1000\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- Generic views/ViewSet에서는 자동 적용된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s043-8.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1241 ;
    djr:text "- `APIView`를 직접 사용하면 수동으로 페이지네이션을 호출해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 8.5 기존 DRF API 버전 관리 [DRF]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "8.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# settings.py -- Accept Header 방식 (DRF 공식 권장)\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    \"DEFAULT_VERSIONING_CLASS\": \"rest_framework.versioning.AcceptHeaderVersioning\",\n    \"DEFAULT_VERSION\": \"1.0\",\n    \"ALLOWED_VERSIONS\": [\"1.0\", \"2.0\"],\n}\n\n# 또는 URL Path 방식 (가장 흔한 실용적 선택)\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    \"DEFAULT_VERSIONING_CLASS\": \"rest_framework.versioning.URLPathVersioning\",\n}\n\n# urls.py\nurlpatterns = [\n    path(\"api/v1/\", include(\"apps.api.v1.urls\")),\n    path(\"api/v2/\", include(\"apps.api.v2.urls\")),\n]\n\n# 뷰에서 버전 확인\nclass ArticleViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    def get_serializer_class(self):\n        if self.request.version == \"2.0\":\n            return ArticleV2Serializer\n        return ArticleV1Serializer\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1242 ;
    djr:text "- 기존 DRF 프로젝트에서 **AcceptHeaderVersioning**은 URL을 깔끔하게 유지하며 일반적으로 best practice로 간주된다 (DRF 공식 문서). 단, 프로젝트 요구에 따라 URLPathVersioning 등 다른 방식도 적합할 수 있다. **[DRF]**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- **URLPathVersioning**은 가장 직관적이고 널리 사용된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1243 ;
    djr:text "- 버전 간 호환성 유지를 위해 필드 추가는 허용하되, 기존 필드 삭제/변경은 새 버전에서만 수행한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s044-8.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s045-9> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 9. 시그널 사용 가이드라인"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s045-9/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s045-9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1244 ;
    djr:text "\n시그널은 Django에서 가장 논쟁적인 기능 중 하나다. **올바른 사용 시나리오를 명확히 알아야 한다.**\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.1 시그널을 사용해야 하는 경우 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1245, djr:R-1246 ;
    djr:text "\n> BC «경계 간» 동작 트리거는 signal 이 아니라 `published_event/`·`event_subscription/` 소유다(#89·#90) — 아래 예는 같은 BC 내부·서드파티 모델 수신 한정.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 좋은 예 1: 서드파티 라이브러리 모델에 후크 (코드를 직접 수정 불가)\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import User\nfrom django.db.models.signals import post_save\nfrom django.dispatch import receiver\n\n@receiver(post_save, sender=User)\ndef create_user_profile(sender, instance, created, **kwargs):\n    if created:\n        Profile.objects.create(user=instance)\n\n# 좋은 예 2: 순환 의존 방지\n# app_a가 app_b에 의존하는데, app_b에서 app_a의 동작을 트리거해야 할 때\n# app_b는 시그널을 보내고, app_a는 리시버를 연결한다.\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "**시그널이 적절한 경우:**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1> ;
