    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1247 ;
    djr:text "- 제어할 수 없는 서드파티 모델에 반응할 때\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
