    djr:text "- 순환 의존을 만들지 않고 앱 간 통신이 필요할 때\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s046-9.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
