    djr:text "- 많은 수의 모델에 같은 핸들러를 일괄 적용할 때\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s047-9.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.2 시그널을 피해야 하는 경우 (안티패턴) [HS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s047-9.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s047-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1250 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 같은 앱 내에서 시그널 사용 -- 직접 호출이 더 명확\n@receiver(post_save, sender=Order)\ndef send_order_email(sender, instance, created, **kwargs):\n    if created:\n        send_confirmation_email(instance)\n\n# 좋은 예: save() 오버라이드 또는 서비스 함수에서 직접 호출 (외부 부수효과는 커밋 전 실행 금지 — §16.4 on_commit 정렬이 전제다)\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    def save(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        is_new = self._state.adding\n        super().save(*args, **kwargs)\n        if is_new:\n            send_confirmation_email(self)\n\n# 또는 서비스 레이어에서\ndef order_create(*, user, items):\n    order = Order.objects.create(user=user)\n    order.add_items(items)\n    send_confirmation_email(order)\n    return order\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s047-9.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s047-9.2> ;
