<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s055-11.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s055-11.2> ;
