    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1285 ;
    djr:text "- Django Debug Toolbar로 느린 쿼리를 식별하고, `EXPLAIN ANALYZE`로 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s056-11.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.3 save(update_fields=...) [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s056-11.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s056-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1286 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 모든 필드를 업데이트\narticle.title = \"New Title\"\narticle.save()  # 모든 컬럼이 SET 절에 포함\n\n# 좋은 예: 변경된 필드만 업데이트\narticle.title = \"New Title\"\narticle.save(update_fields=[\"title\"])  # title만 UPDATE\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s056-11.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s056-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 동시성이 높은 환경에서 다른 필드의 변경을 덮어쓰는 것을 방지한다.\n- 업데이트되는 데이터 양을 줄여 성능이 개선된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s057-11.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.4 exists()와 count() [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s057-11.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s057-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1287, djr:R-1288 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 전체 쿼리셋을 평가하여 존재 여부 확인\nif Article.objects.filter(status=ArticleStatus.PUBLISHED):  # 모든 행을 로드\n    ...\n\n# 좋은 예: exists()로 존재 여부만 확인\nif Article.objects.filter(status=ArticleStatus.PUBLISHED).exists():  # LIMIT 1\n    ...\n\n# 나쁜 예: len()으로 개수 확인\ncount = len(Article.objects.all())  # 모든 객체를 메모리에 로드\n\n# 좋은 예: count()로 DB에서 카운트\ncount = Article.objects.count()  # SELECT COUNT(*)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s057-11.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
