    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.2 캐시 무효화 패턴 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 버전 기반 캐시 키\ndef get_article_cache_key(article_id):\n    article = Article.objects.only(\"updated_at\").get(pk=article_id)\n    return f\"article:{article_id}:v{article.updated_at.timestamp()}\"\n\n# 모델 save 시 관련 캐시 삭제\nclass Article(models.Model):\n    def save(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        super().save(*args, **kwargs)\n        cache.delete(f\"article:{self.pk}\")\n        cache.delete(\"article_list\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1289 ;
    djr:text "- 자주 변경되는 데이터는 캐싱 효과가 낮다 -- 캐시 적합성을 먼저 판단한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- 캐시 키에 **버전 정보**를 포함하면 수동 무효화 빈도를 줄일 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s060-12.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
