<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.1 Django 내장 보안 기능 [DDoc] [OWASP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango는 주요 웹 취약점에 대한 방어를 내장하고 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 공격 유형 | Django 방어 | 주의사항 |\n|-----------|------------|----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1291 ;
    djr:text "| **CSRF** | `CsrfViewMiddleware` + `{% csrf_token %}` | `@csrf_exempt`는 극히 제한적으로 사용 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1292 ;
    djr:text "| **XSS** | 템플릿 자동 이스케이핑 | `|safe`, `mark_safe()` 사용 시 주의 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1293 ;
    djr:text "| **SQL Injection** | ORM이 파라미터화 쿼리 사용 | `raw()`, `extra()`에서 직접 문자열 보간 금지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s062-13.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1294 ;
    djr:text "| **Clickjacking** | `XFrameOptionsMiddleware` | `X_FRAME_OPTIONS = \"DENY\"` 설정 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s063-13.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.2 보안 설정 체크리스트 [DDoc] [OWASP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s063-13.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s063-13.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1295, djr:R-1296, djr:R-1297 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# config/settings/production.py\n\n# HTTPS 강제\nSECURE_SSL_REDIRECT = True\nSECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER = (\"HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PROTO\", \"https\")\n\n# HSTS (HTTP Strict Transport Security)\nSECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 31536000  # 1년\nSECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS = True\nSECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD = True\n\n# 쿠키 보안\nSESSION_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE = \"Strict\"\nCSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nCSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True  # 주의: Django 공식 문서는 CSRF에 대한 실질적 보호 효과가 없다고 명시. 보안 감사 요구사항이 있을 때만 사용. AJAX 사용 시 문제 발생 가능\n\n# 콘텐츠 보안\nSECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF = True\nX_FRAME_OPTIONS = \"DENY\"\n\n# Django 보안 체크 실행\n# python manage.py check --deploy\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s064-13.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 13.3 Raw SQL 안전하게 사용 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "13.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s064-13.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s064-13.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1298, djr:R-1299 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 나쁜 예: 문자열 보간으로 SQL Injection 취약\nModel.objects.raw(f\"SELECT * FROM app_model WHERE name = '{user_input}'\")\n\n# 좋은 예: 파라미터화 쿼리\nModel.objects.raw(\"SELECT * FROM app_model WHERE name = %s\", [user_input])\n\n# 나쁜 예: extra()에서 직접 보간\nqueryset.extra(where=[f\"name = '{user_input}'\"])\n\n# 좋은 예: extra()에서 파라미터 사용\nqueryset.extra(where=[\"name = %s\"], params=[user_input])\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s066-14> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 14. 테스트 패턴"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s066-14/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s066-14> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1300, djr:R-1301, djr:R-1302 ;
    djr:text "\n이 절은 `discipline-tdd` 입장 심사에서 `add`/`update`된 테스트의 Django mechanics를 고르는 작성 recipe다. framework class·fixture·transaction framework 자체를 시험하기 위해 테스트를 만들지 않으며, 실제 승인된 테스트가 있을 때만 아래 class와 layout을 선택한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.1 TestCase 선택 기준 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1303 ;
    djr:text "\n| 클래스 | 특징 | 사용 시나리오 |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| `SimpleTestCase` | DB 접근 불가, 가장 빠름 | 유틸리티 함수, 폼 검증 테스트 |\n| `TestCase` | 트랜잭션 롤백으로 격리, 빠름 | **대부분의 테스트** |\n| `TransactionTestCase` | 실제 트랜잭션 커밋, 느림 | `select_for_update()`, DB 트리거 테스트 |\n| `LiveServerTestCase` | 실제 서버 실행 | Selenium 통합 테스트 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1304, djr:R-1305 ;
    djr:text "> 이 표는 Django 원생 지식(기존 스위트 읽기용)이다 — 이 파이프라인의 «신규 add» 테스트는 무조건 pytest 관용구다(등가: `TestCase`→`@pytest.mark.django_db` · `TransactionTestCase`→`@pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)` — `implementation-test` §16).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s067-14.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom django.test import TestCase\n\nclass ArticleModelTest(TestCase):\n    def test_publish_sets_published_at(self):\n        \"\"\"publish()가 published_at을 설정하는지 검증.\"\"\"\n        article = Article.objects.create(title=\"Test\", author=self.user)\n        article.publish()\n        article.refresh_from_db()\n        self.assertIsNotNone(article.published_at)\n        self.assertEqual(article.status, Article.Status.PUBLISHED)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.3 pytest-django 활용 [TDD]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom django.test import Client\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef api_client():\n    return Client()\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef authenticated_user(db):\n    user = UserFactory()\n    return user\n\n@pytest.mark.django_db\nclass TestArticleAPI:\n    def test_create_article(self, api_client, authenticated_user):\n        api_client.force_login(authenticated_user)\n        response = api_client.post(\"/api/articles/\", {\n            \"title\": \"Test Article\",\n            \"body\": \"Content\",\n        })\n        assert response.status_code == 201\n        assert Article.objects.count() == 1\n\n    def test_list_published_articles(self, api_client):\n        ArticleFactory.create_batch(3, published=True)\n        response = api_client.get(\"/api/articles/\")\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n        assert len(response.json()[\"results\"]) == 3\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1306 ;
    djr:text "- `@pytest.mark.django_db`로 DB 접근을 명시한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "- pytest 픽스처로 테스트 설정 코드를 50% 이상 줄일 수 있다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s069-14.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s054-11.1/b1> ;
    djr:text "- 쿼리 수가 승인된 성능 계약이고 독자 failure로 입장된 테스트에서만 `assertNumQueries`로 회귀를 방지한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s070-14.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 14.4 테스트에서의 Django 공식 규칙 [DCS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "14.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s070-14.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s070-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1307, djr:R-1308, djr:R-1309 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# 좋은 예: assertIs(x, True) -- 타입까지 검증\nself.assertIs(article.is_published, True)\n\n# 나쁜 예: assertTrue() -- truthy 값도 통과\nself.assertTrue(article.is_published)  # 1, \"yes\" 등도 통과\n\n# 좋은 예: assertRaisesMessage() -- 에러 메시지까지 검증\nwith self.assertRaisesMessage(ValidationError, \"이미 등록된 이메일\"):\n    form.clean_email()\n\n# 독스트링은 기대 동작을 바로 서술 (Tests that... 같은 전치사 없이)\ndef test_publish_sets_status(self):\n    \"\"\"publish() sets status to PUBLISHED and saves published_at.\"\"\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s070-14.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s070-14.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 15.1 미들웨어 실행 순서 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "15.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```\n요청 -> SecurityMiddleware -> SessionMiddleware -> CommonMiddleware\n     -> CsrfViewMiddleware -> AuthenticationMiddleware -> MessageMiddleware\n     -> XFrameOptionsMiddleware -> 뷰\n응답 <- (역순)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- 요청은 `MIDDLEWARE` 리스트의 **위에서 아래**로, 응답은 **아래에서 위로** 흐른다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s072-15.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1310 ;
    djr:text "- `SecurityMiddleware`는 반드시 첫 번째, `SessionMiddleware`는 `AuthenticationMiddleware` 앞에 위치한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 15.2 커스텀 미들웨어 작성 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "15.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nimport time\nimport logging\n\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\n\nclass RequestTimingMiddleware:\n    \"\"\"각 요청의 처리 시간을 로깅하는 미들웨어.\"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n        # 서버 시작 시 한 번만 실행\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        # 요청 처리 전 (process_request에 해당)\n        start_time = time.monotonic()\n\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n\n        # 응답 처리 후 (process_response에 해당)\n        duration = time.monotonic() - start_time\n        logger.info(\n            \"method=%s path=%s status=%s duration=%.3fs\",\n            request.method,\n            request.path,\n            response.status_code,\n            duration,\n        )\n        return response\n\n    def process_exception(self, request, exception):\n        \"\"\"뷰에서 예외 발생 시 호출.\"\"\"\n        logger.exception(\"Unhandled exception in %s\", request.path)\n        return None  # None 반환 시 기본 예외 처리 계속\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1311 ;
    djr:text "- 미들웨어는 **모든 요청**에 실행되므로 가볍게 유지한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1312 ;
    djr:text "- 하나의 미들웨어는 하나의 관심사만 담당한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s073-15.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- `get_response` 호출 전 코드는 요청 경로, 호출 후 코드는 응답 경로에서 실행된다.\n\n"@ko .

