<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.1 서비스 레이어가 필요한 시점 [TSD] [HS] [CP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1313, djr:R-1314 ;
    djr:text "\nFat Model이 비대해졌다는 판단은 파일 길이보다 변경 이유와 orchestration 복잡도로 한다. 단순한 한 모델의 행위는 모델 메서드나 custom QuerySet으로 충분하며, service layer는 다음 기준 중 하나 이상이 실제로 있을 때 도입한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1315 ;
    djr:text "- 하나의 use case가 여러 모델, 여러 aggregate, 또는 여러 adapter를 조율한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1316 ;
    djr:text "- 같은 비즈니스 흐름이 view, API, management command, task, signal 등 여러 entry point에 중복된다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1317 ;
    djr:text "- use case가 명시적인 transaction boundary를 소유한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1318 ;
    djr:text "- 이메일, 결제, 파일, 메시지 publish 같은 외부 side effect가 DB write와 함께 정렬되어야 한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1319 ;
    djr:text "- 모델이 domain behavior보다 persistence/orchestration 세부사항 때문에 이해하기 어려워진다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1320 ;
    djr:text "파일 크기 자체는 보조 신호일 뿐이다. 실제로 함께 이해되고 함께 바뀌는 짧은 절차는 service로 억지 분리하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.2 HackSoft 서비스/셀렉터 패턴 [HS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# services.py -- 쓰기(Command) 로직\ndef user_create(*, email: str, password: str) -> User:\n    \"\"\"사용자를 생성하고 환영 이메일을 보낸다.\"\"\"\n    user = User.objects.create_user(email=email, password=password)\n    Profile.objects.create(user=user)\n    send_welcome_email(user=user)\n    return user\n\ndef order_confirm(*, order: Order) -> Order:\n    \"\"\"주문을 확정한다.\"\"\"\n    if order.status != Order.Status.PENDING:\n        raise ValidationError(\"확정할 수 없는 상태입니다.\")\n    order.status = Order.Status.CONFIRMED\n    order.confirmed_at = timezone.now()\n    order.save(update_fields=[\"status\", \"confirmed_at\"])\n    notify_warehouse(order=order)\n    return order\n\n# selectors.py -- 읽기(Query) 로직\ndef article_list(*, author: User | None = None, status: str | None = None):\n    \"\"\"필터 조건에 따라 기사 목록을 반환한다.\"\"\"\n    qs = Article.objects.select_related(\"author\")\n    if author:\n        qs = qs.filter(author=author)\n    if status:\n        qs = qs.filter(status=status)\n    return qs.order_by(\"-published_at\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b5> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1321, djr:R-1322 ;
    djr:text "위 `order_confirm`의 `Order.Status` 참조는 평면 Django(기존 관례) 예시다 — 표준 4계층 트리에서는 상태 판정·전이가 도메인 애그리거트 소유이고 값 집합은 domain Enum에서 파생한다(§2.5 계층 소유·`architecture-ddd` §3.2). 어느 경우든 상태 값은 심볼로만 소비한다(리터럴 비교 금지).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1323 ;
    djr:text "**네이밍 규칙: `<entity>_<action>`** -- `user_create`, `order_confirm`, `article_list`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1324 ;
    djr:text "- 네임스페이싱: `user_` 접두사로 사용자 관련 서비스를 묶는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s076-16.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- 검색 용이: `grep \"def user_\"` 로 모든 사용자 관련 동작을 찾을 수 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.3 DDD와 Django의 트레이드오프 [CP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\n# Django ORM은 Active Record 패턴 -- 도메인 모델과 영속성 모델이 같은 객체\n# DDD의 Repository 패턴을 적용하려면 수동 변환 레이어가 필요\n\n# 방법 A: Django ORM 직접 사용 (대부분의 프로젝트에 적합)\n# - Django의 배터리(admin, forms, migrations)를 그대로 활용\n# - 도메인 로직은 모델 메서드 + 서비스 레이어에 배치\n\n# 방법 B: Repository 패턴 도입 (복잡한 도메인에 적합)\nclass ArticleRepository:\n    def get_by_id(self, article_id: int) -> Article:\n        return Article.objects.get(pk=article_id)\n\n    def save(self, article: Article) -> None:\n        article.save()\n\n    def published_by_author(self, author: User) -> QuerySet:\n        return Article.objects.filter(\n            author=author, status=Article.Status.PUBLISHED\n        )\n# 장점: 테스트에서 Fake Repository로 교체 가능\n# 단점: Django의 풍부한 QuerySet API를 래핑하는 추가 비용\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "**실용적 권고:**\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1325 ;
    djr:text "- 대부분의 Django 프로젝트에서는 **모델 메서드 + 서비스 함수**로 충분하다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1326 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인이 정말 복잡해질 때만 Repository 패턴을 점진적으로 도입한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s077-16.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- DDD의 모든 패턴을 Django에 강제하면 Django의 장점(admin, migrations, forms)을 재구현하게 된다. **[CP]**\n- 서비스 레이어는 좋은 출발점 -- 뷰와 모델 사이에 얇은 계층을 두어 비즈니스 로직을 격리한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.4 트랜잭션과 일관성 경계 [DDoc] [CP]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1327, djr:R-1328 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango write flow는 use case 단위로 commit/rollback 경계를 정한다. 모든 코드를 큰 transaction으로 감싸는 것이 아니라, 함께 성공하거나 함께 실패해야 하는 최소 블록에 `transaction.atomic()`을 둔다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1345 ;
    djr:text "Risky write를 구현하거나 리뷰할 때는 다음 항목을 명시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "| 항목 | 확인 내용 |\n|------|-----------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1346 ;
    djr:text "| transaction owner | 어떤 service/use case가 atomic boundary를 소유하는가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1347 ;
    djr:text "| lock/idempotency | `select_for_update`, optimistic check, unique constraint, idempotency table 중 무엇으로 중복과 race를 막는가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1348 ;
    djr:text "| DB constraint | application bug나 다른 writer가 있어도 DB가 지켜야 하는 invariant는 무엇인가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1349 ;
    djr:text "| side effect timing | email/payment/message/cache invalidation이 commit 전후 어디에서 실행되는가 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1350 ;
    djr:text "| isolation/retry | serialization failure, deadlock, duplicate key 같은 실패를 retry할지 forward-fix할지 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1351 ;
    djr:text "| verification candidates | transaction/constraint/race/rollback 등 보호할 위험·failure 후보와 근거. `TransactionTestCase`, concurrency/integration test, query-count check는 입장 결정 뒤 선택할 mechanics이고 migration SQL review는 별도 비테스트 검증 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1352, djr:R-1353, djr:R-1354 ;
    djr:text "`verification candidates` 행은 테스트 의무가 아니며 결정은 `discipline-tdd`가 소유한다. DB unique/race/rollback/CAS가 다른 boundary와 독립된 production failure일 때만 coder가 `add`할 수 있고, HTTP 등이 같은 제품 failure를 이미 잡으며 독자 DB mechanism이 없으면 `reuse`한다. `add`된 테스트의 일반 DB-backed behavior에는 plain `@pytest.mark.django_db`를 쓰고, commit hook·lock·DB trigger·transaction isolation을 실제로 보호해야 할 때만 `@pytest.mark.django_db(transaction=True)`나 실제 DB 기반 integration test를 쓴다(기존 `TestCase` 스위트는 재작성하지 않는다 — 이 등가는 신규 `add` 에만). class 선택이나 transaction framework 자체는 새 테스트의 근거가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1329 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom django.db import transaction\n\ndef order_confirm(*, order: Order) -> Order:\n    with transaction.atomic():\n        order = (\n            Order.objects\n            .select_for_update()\n            .get(pk=order.pk)\n        )\n        order.confirm()\n        order.save(update_fields=[\"status\", \"confirmed_at\"])\n\n        # 표준 트리 응용 계층에서는 uow.after_commit(...) 소유다(#200) — on_commit 직접 호출은 평면 Django 형태\n        transaction.on_commit(lambda: notify_warehouse(order_id=order.id))\n\n    return order\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1330 ;
    djr:text "- `transaction.atomic()`의 owner는 model method보다 application service가 되는 경우가 많다. 여러 모델 write, 여러 invariant, 외부 side effect가 하나의 use case에 묶일 때 특히 그렇다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1331, djr:R-1332 ;
    djr:text "- `select_for_update()`는 pessimistic lock이 필요한 경우에만 사용한다. 잠금 범위, DB backend 지원, 테스트 환경에서 실제 lock 동작을 검증할 수 있는지 함께 확인한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1333, djr:R-1334 ;
    djr:text "- 중복 write 방지는 application-level check만 믿지 않는다. 반드시 지켜야 하는 invariant는 `UniqueConstraint`, `CheckConstraint`, partial unique index, idempotency storage 같은 DB boundary와 함께 설계한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1335, djr:R-1336, djr:R-1337, djr:R-1338, djr:R-1339, djr:R-1340 ;
    djr:text "- 개발용 **sqlite에서 `select_for_update()`는 no-op**이다(락 SQL 미발행). 이 한계를 커스텀 DB 백엔드(`BEGIN IMMEDIATE` 등)로 우회하지 말 것 — 운영(Postgres) 정합을 위해 잠금 코드는 두되, 불변식은 `CheckConstraint`(위 항목)가 최종 방어선이고 race 패자의 `IntegrityError`는 표현 계층에서 상태 코드(예: 409)로 변환한다. 잠금이 부족해 보여도 백엔드를 만들지 말고 DB architecture 검토(`architecture-db` §9.5 락·동시성 제어)로 돌린다. **이 금지는 출처-불문이다** — `DatabaseWrapper` 상속뿐 아니라 런타임 몽키패치, `connection_created` 시그널, `OPTIONS`의 `init_command`로 `BEGIN`/PRAGMA 주입, `isolation_level` 조작, DB 미들웨어, 테스트 conftest 패치 등 *어떤 형태로든* 엔진/연결의 트랜잭션·락·격리 의미를 바꾸면 동일한 위반이다(테스트 격리 전용이라도 프로덕션 경로에 새면 안 된다). **필요한 연결 튜닝은 stock `OPTIONS`로만** 한다 — `transaction_mode`(5.1+)로 begin 모드, `timeout`으로 busy 대기, 안전 PRAGMA(`foreign_keys`·`busy_timeout`·`synchronous`·`cache_size`)까지가 허용 범위이고, 격리·락 의미를 바꾸는 변경(`journal_mode`=WAL·`isolation_level`·`locking_mode`·`read_uncommitted`·커스텀 begin 모드)은 설계가 명시 승인할 때만 한다(`architecture-db` §9.5).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1341, djr:R-1342 ;
    djr:text "- 외부 side effect는 commit 전에 실행하지 않는다. DB write가 rollback될 수 있으면 `transaction.on_commit()`으로 email, message publish, payment follow-up, cache invalidation 시점을 정렬한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1343 ;
    djr:text "- isolation level, retry, optimistic/pessimistic locking 선택은 DB 특성과 실패 모드에 따라 달라진다. 결정이 불명확하면 DB architecture 검토가 먼저다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1344 ;
    djr:text "- HTTP로 노출된 risky write는 API layer의 `Idempotency-Key` 계약과 DB idempotency storage가 서로 맞아야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.5 트랜잭셔널 Outbox 구현 [DDoc]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1355, djr:R-1356, djr:R-1357, djr:R-1358 ;
    djr:text "\n메시지 유실이 허용되지 않는 외부 발행은 Outbox로 구현한다(채택 기준은 `architecture-ddd` §3.7, 전달 보장·dead-letter 정책은 `architecture-db` §9.7). Django에서는 outbox 행을 비즈니스 write와 **같은 `transaction.atomic()` 블록**에서 저장하고, 별도 디스패처가 발행한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b5> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1359 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# domain_layer/order/event/event_type.py -- 발행 이벤트 종류의 단일 출처\n# (1종째부터 enum·append-only: birth-enum, architecture-ddd §3.7)\nclass OrderEventType(StrEnum):\n    ORDER_CONFIRMED = \"order.confirmed\"\n\n\n# models.py\nclass OutboxMessage(models.Model):\n    event_type = models.CharField(max_length=200)  # 값은 OrderEventType에서만 -- 대입·filter 소비도 심볼로(§2.5 소비 규율)\n    payload = models.JSONField()\n    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)\n    published_at = models.DateTimeField(null=True, blank=True)\n    retry_count = models.PositiveIntegerField(default=0)\n\n    class Meta:\n        indexes = [models.Index(fields=[\"published_at\", \"id\"])]\n\n\n# services.py -- 비즈니스 write와 같은 트랜잭션에 outbox 기록\ndef confirm_order(*, order: Order) -> Order:\n    with transaction.atomic():\n        order.confirm()\n        order.save(update_fields=[\"status\", \"confirmed_at\"])\n        OutboxMessage.objects.create(\n            event_type=OrderEventType.ORDER_CONFIRMED,\n            payload={\"order_id\": order.id},\n        )\n    return order\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1360, djr:R-1361, djr:R-1362 ;
    djr:text "디스패처는 주기 실행한다 — dddjango 표준 트리에서 그 자리는 `driving_layer/cron_job/`(`<job>_cron_job.py`)이고, management command 는 평면 Django 배경 형태다(#58 — `application/**/management/commands/` 금지). 여러 워커가 같은 행을 집지 않도록 `select_for_update(skip_locked=True)`로 미발행 행을 잠그고, 발행에 성공하면 `published_at`을 찍는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1363 ;
    djr:text "> 아래 예시는 Django 원생 management command 형식(배경)이다 — 표준 트리 코드는 같은 로직을 `cron_job/` 껍데기에서 부른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# management/commands/dispatch_outbox.py\nclass Command(BaseCommand):\n    def handle(self, *args, **options):\n        with transaction.atomic():\n            rows = (\n                OutboxMessage.objects\n                .select_for_update(skip_locked=True)\n                .filter(published_at__isnull=True)\n                .order_by(\"id\")[:100]\n            )\n            for msg in rows:\n                try:\n                    broker.publish(msg.event_type, msg.payload)\n                    msg.published_at = timezone.now()\n                    msg.save(update_fields=[\"published_at\"])\n                except BrokerError:\n                    msg.retry_count += 1\n                    msg.save(update_fields=[\"retry_count\"])\n                    # retry_count가 한계를 넘으면 dead-letter로 이동(별도 플래그/테이블)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1364 ;
    djr:text "- 디스패처가 발행 후 `published_at` 기록 전에 죽으면 재실행 시 같은 메시지를 다시 발행한다 -> **at-least-once**. 소비자는 멱등해야 한다(`architecture-db` §9.7).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1365 ;
    djr:text "- 단순 in-process 후속 작업(유실 허용)은 outbox 없이 `transaction.on_commit()`으로 충분하다(§16.4).\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "#### Composite Primary Key -- 복합 기본키"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n```python\nfrom django.db.models import CompositePrimaryKey\n\nclass OrderItem(models.Model):\n    pk = CompositePrimaryKey(\"order_id\", \"product_id\")\n    order = models.ForeignKey(Order, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n    product = models.ForeignKey(Product, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n    quantity = models.IntegerField(default=1)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "- `pk` 속성은 구성 필드 값의 **튜플**이다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-1366, djr:R-1367 ;
    djr:text "- ⚠ 위 `OrderItem`은 복합 PK 기능 데모이며 `order`·`product` FK는 *같은 BC 내* 가정이다. `product`가 **다른 BC**의 애그리거트면 `ForeignKey(Product)` 대신 `product_id` 값 참조로 둔다(BC 경계 ORM FK 금지 — `architecture-ddd` §3.3 규칙3 영속성 확장).\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s087> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- **제약사항**: 기존 모델에서 복합 PK로 마이그레이션 불가, ForeignKey가 복합 PK 모델을 가리킬 수 없음, admin 미지원.\n\n"@ko .
